  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "2c924556-82c0-4014-a7d7-735ea397f1b6",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# 09 Modifik\u00E1tory p\u0159\u00EDstupu public a private\n**autor: Erik Kr\u00E1l ekral@utb.cz**\n\n---\n\nPro zvl\u00E1dnut\u00ED p\u0159\u00EDkladu pot\u0159ebujete zn\u00E1t modifik\u00E1tor p\u0159\u00EDstupu \u0060public\u0060 a \u0060private\u0060 a um\u011Bt jej pou\u017E\u00EDvat s fieldy a metodami. "
    },
    {
      "id": "9e6f002f-265e-40af-85b0-48f225763b6b",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Na n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00EDch p\u0159\u00EDkladech si probereme jednotliv\u00E9 p\u0159\u00EDkazy. "
    },
    {
      "id": "fb940ed8-3a70-4323-afbb-f5c92858fce9",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Nejprve si definujeme t\u0159\u00EDdu pro kruh, kter\u00E1 bude m\u00EDt \u0060public\u0060 field \u0060polomer\u0060:"
    },
    {
      "id": "1a4079d5-ab8c-47c1-8fbc-b0fdacf80c25",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "class Kruh\n{\n    public double polomer;\n\n    public Kruh()\n    {\n        polomer = 1.0;\n    }\n\n    public Kruh(double polomer)\n    {\n        this.polomer = polomer;\n    }\n}"
    },
    {
      "id": "fc368c70-7abf-4807-9581-4a51a2f6c7f5",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Pokud je field nebo metoda \u0060public\u0060 tak k n\u00ED m\u016F\u017Eeme p\u0159istupovat i v klientsk\u00E9m k\u00F3du mimo metody t\u0159\u00EDdy nebo struktury ve kter\u00E9 je field definovan\u00FD."
    },
    {
      "id": "12ca3527-d5a2-4444-973c-2f66bfef3661",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "Kruh kruh = new Kruh();\nkruh.polomer = 10.0;\nConsole.WriteLine(kruh.polomer);\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "e360dbdc-78b6-4b6a-9c46-95e48509a1de",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Pokud je field nebo metoda \u0060private\u0060 tak k n\u00ED nem\u016F\u017Eeme p\u0159istupovat v klientsk\u00E9m k\u00F3du mimo metody t\u0159\u00EDdy nebo struktury ve kter\u00E9 je field definovan\u00FD. M\u016F\u017Eeme ale definovat \u0060public\u0060 metody a s jejich pomoc\u00ED potom k \u0060private\u0060 fieldu p\u0159istupovat. V n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00EDm p\u0159\u00EDkladu m\u00E1 kruh \u0060private\u0060 field \u0060polomer\u0060 a \u0060public\u0060 metody \u0060VratPolomer\u0060 a \u0060NastavPolomer\u0060."
    },
    {
      "id": "c91afa15-a4ff-4752-89df-ec6117d378f5",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "class Kruh\n{\n    private double polomer;\n\n    public double VratPolomer()\n    {\n        return polomer;\n    }\n\n    public void NastavPolomer(double polomer)\n    {\n        this.polomer = polomer;\n    }\n}"
    },
    {
      "id": "6c2be6ba-e29b-4f0d-b301-5a3f778da8b3",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Mimo t\u0159\u00EDdu \u0060Kruh\u0060 v klientsk\u00E9m k\u00F3du potom nem\u016F\u017Eeme p\u0159istupovat k fieldu \u0060polomer\u0060 p\u0159\u00EDmo ale jen pomoc\u00ED metod \u0060VratPolomer\u0060 a \u0060NastavPolomer\u0060."
    },
    {
      "id": "5daa337c-d481-4a3c-be2b-2aa0af5a9470",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "Kruh kruh = new Kruh();\n//kruh.polomer = 10.0; // nelze prelozit protoze polomer je private\n//Console.WriteLine(kruh.polomer); // nelze prelozit protoze polomer je private\nkruh.NastavPolomer(10);\nConsole.WriteLine(kruh.VratPolomer()); "
    },
    {
      "id": "adc99658-471a-4920-9f71-42cdca98ac94",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "class BankovniUcet\n{\n    private double zustatek;\n\n    public BankovniUcet()\n    {\n        zustatek = 1000.0;\n    }\n\n    public void Vyber(double castka)\n    {\n        if(castka \u003E zustatek)\n        {\n            throw new ArgumentOutOfRangeException(\u0022Castka je vetsi nez zustatek\u0022);\n        }\n\n        zustatek -= castka;\n    }\n\n    public double VratZustatek()\n    {\n        return zustatek;\n    }\n}"
    },
    {
      "id": "5aa779ed-2f01-4e8f-8f0e-8d3f38fba30f",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "BankovniUcet ucet = new BankovniUcet();\nstring vstup = await Microsoft.DotNet.Interactive.Kernel.GetInputAsync();\n\nif(double.TryParse(vstup, out double castka))\n{\n    if(castka \u003E ucet.VratZustatek())\n    {\n        Console.WriteLine(\u0022Castka je vyssi nez zustatek\u0022);\n    }\n    else\n    {\n        ucet.Vyber(castka);\n        Console.WriteLine(\u0022Vyber\u0022);\n    }\n}"
    }
  ]
}